comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-02T14:10:55.004Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: all-status searches for GH-859, pm-beads comment loss, Beads export lossiness, and prior importer parity found no active owner. Closed pm-axl0 covered earlier importer lossiness but not current comment/event source completeness; this item preserves that lineage rather than reopening shipped scope."
  "2026-08-26T18:50:49.932Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: current Beads file import silently accepts comment_count with no comments and the new portable-backup acceptance cannot run because --backup-dir is absent; focused package tests failed before implementation."
  "2026-08-26T20:48:43.065Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: manual fresh-workspace portable-backup import completed with complete=true and exact source/import parity: issues=3, events=2, comments=1, dependencies=1, labels=2. Readback retained the exact discussion body and a structured JSON status-change event note; full suite 8,020/8,020 and exact coverage 100/100/100/100 passed."
  "2026-08-26T20:58:06.029Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence: post-closeout defect-evidence correctly failed closed until this production defect had structured prevention evidence. Bound closure to the beads-portable-backup-completeness gate, incomplete-export/count/foreign-key negative controls, focused Beads tests, exact coverage, defect-evidence, and hosted static/coverage checks. No waiver is used."
  "2026-08-27T00:22:05.369Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: focused review-remediation run failed the new preflight test because Safe-A1 was already written before an unsafe preserved parent/dependency ID was rejected (expected NOT_FOUND, received success). The test covers parent, string dependency, and object depends_on_id forms."
  "2026-08-27T01:10:22.201Z","harness:codex","Final verification: portable-backup preflight now validates preserved parent plus string and object dependency IDs before the first write; regression suite passes 28/28. Manual isolated install imported 3 issues, 2 events, 1 comment, 1 dependency, and 2 labels with exact preserved IDs and parity receipts. Full repository coverage passes 8029 tests at 100/100/100/100; static quality, 100% source/exported/member docstrings, lint, zero-clone jscpd, 88-command package dogfood, and credential scan all pass."
  "2026-08-27T01:33:29.858Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence from exact-head CodeRabbit round: a realistic portable dependency row carrying its own id and item_id imported dependency-row-1 instead of depends_on_id Tokenwerk-B2; focused Beads acceptance failed on exact target identity."
  "2026-08-27T02:27:09.972Z","harness:codex","Evidence: Corrected portable Beads dependency import so depends_on_id is authoritative even when a backup row also carries its own id or item_id. The realistic v0.62 fixture now proves the source row identity cannot replace the target. Linked plan passed 28/28; full repository gate passed 584 files and 8031 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-27T04:01:42.413Z","harness:codex","Review TDD red: CodeRabbit exact-head review 5037100816 reports the package README now embeds the detailed portable and legacy migration runbook instead of routing it to focused documentation."
  "2026-08-27T04:42:59.559Z","harness:codex","Review-fix evidence: the package README now routes operational migration detail to packages/pm-beads/docs/MIGRATION.md, which retains the complete portable-backup, completeness, parity, and legacy recovery runbook. Documentation links pass, Beads regression suite passes 28/28, repository lint/typecheck pass, dependency audit is clean, and full coverage remains exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-27T04:57:56.272Z","harness:codex","Review TDD intake: CodeRabbit exact-head review 5037361338 identified zero-comment legacy export over-refusal and imprecise missing-file negative controls."
  "2026-08-27T05:00:30.033Z","harness:codex","TDD red: a legacy Beads record with comment_count=0 was refused as lossy before import. The same focused run also showed the tightened missing-file assertion must match the embedded absolute path by filename rather than the interrupted phrase."
  "2026-08-27T05:22:44.451Z","harness:codex","Review closure evidence: Beads legacy imports now accept explicit comment_count=0 while still refusing positive counts without relational comment data; missing portable-backup table diagnostics identify the exact filename. Focused linked suite passed 29/29 and repository coverage passed 8,037/8,037 at exact 100/100/100/100. Fresh temp acceptance at /tmp/pm-cli-review-e2e-Cgqkrk imported pm-manual-zero, refused comment_count=1 with exit 2 before writes, and confirmed pm-manual-positive remained absent."
